{"5169720":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dialshift","steam_appid":5169720,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5181720,5185620],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE RING. TWO DIRECTIONS. NO BRAKES.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cursor never stops. You choose clockwise or counterclockwise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every input changes your direction and counts as a hit attempt. Land it, keep your combo, and protect your Stability. Miss, and watch everything fall apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"A neon cursor reverses around a circular arena and lands timed hits on yellow targets.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY HIT CHANGES WHAT COMES NEXT.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing alone will not save you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean hit can set up the next target. A panic turn can leave you stranded across the ring. Read the whole dial, choose your route, and stay in control as the speed climbs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"The cursor follows arrow-marked targets around the ring, changing direction to make clean hits.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEVEN MODES. TWO BUTTONS.<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic:<\/strong> Pure timing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme:<\/strong> No warmup.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow:<\/strong> Follow the direction.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch:<\/strong> Every hit reverses you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold:<\/strong> Stay locked through the arc.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pulse:<\/strong> Break the target one hit at a time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate:<\/strong> Everything at once. Good luck.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"The cursor strikes shielded targets repeatedly on a colorful circular arena.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUST ONE MORE RUN. I SWEAR!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has its own scores, ranks, and online leaderboard. Chase perfect hits, keep ridiculous combos alive, earn Steam achievements, and fight your way to S+.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss. Reset. Countdown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This one will be clean.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"Several target types appear together as the cursor races around the ring and lands successive hits.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE RING. TWO DIRECTIONS. NO BRAKES.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cursor never stops. You choose clockwise or counterclockwise.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every input changes your direction and counts as a hit attempt. Land it, keep your combo, and protect your Stability. Miss, and watch everything fall apart.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"A neon cursor reverses around a circular arena and lands timed hits on yellow targets.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/f341cc174100009d2053d3bd01b1321e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY HIT CHANGES WHAT COMES NEXT.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing alone will not save you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clean hit can set up the next target. A panic turn can leave you stranded across the ring. Read the whole dial, choose your route, and stay in control as the speed climbs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"The cursor follows arrow-marked targets around the ring, changing direction to make clean hits.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/c6a5e231ec3bc1560a0b78bde888a40e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEVEN MODES. TWO BUTTONS.<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic:<\/strong> Pure timing.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extreme:<\/strong> No warmup.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flow:<\/strong> Follow the direction.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch:<\/strong> Every hit reverses you.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold:<\/strong> Stay locked through the arc.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pulse:<\/strong> Break the target one hit at a time.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate:<\/strong> Everything at once. Good luck.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"The cursor strikes shielded targets repeatedly on a colorful circular arena.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/94274e6e1bed8ab8a957db28a3613f0e.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUST ONE MORE RUN. I SWEAR!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has its own scores, ranks, and online leaderboard. Chase perfect hits, keep ridiculous combos alive, earn Steam achievements, and fight your way to S+.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miss. Reset. Countdown.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This one will be clean.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.poster.avif?t=1793772672\" aria-label=\"Several target types appear together as the cursor races around the ring and lands successive hits.\" width=720 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.webm?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/extras\/681795ddf2f6e72de76f32b7a0ec5af6.mp4?t=1793772672\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Dialshift is a fast score-chasing arcade game played on one relentless ring. Every turn is also a hit. Read the targets, choose your route, and hold your nerve as seven modes twist the rules.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/dd926802c0ea2a0bf6168d868a886cb01ee3e083\/header.jpg?t=1793772672","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/9eff361831973931b637d500844073d052961ac1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793772672","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5169720\/9eff361831973931b637d500844073d052961ac1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793772672","website":"https:\/\/www.gekobyte.at\/press\/dialshift\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200 or AMD FX-4100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 2500 or equivalent; OpenGL 3.3 or Direct3D 11 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or AMD Radeon